README.OSK -- vcron, Paul Vixie's cron for OS-9Paul Vixie's 1987 cron daemon and crontab, as ported to OS-9/68000 by TOP(The OS-9 Project, Munich) for its second release, 1989-90.  The binariesin CMDS/SYSADMIN are TOP's own.  This tree is TOP's USR/SRC/vcron.t.Z,already CR-terminated; do_command.c is "Copyright 1988 by ram", withthe same terms as Vixie's -- ram being Reimer Mellin, by TOP's readme.  Thereis no OS-9 makefile in it, only the Unix one.Changes: none.